liff above a moonlit lake, lanterns glowing on the pier.\n- Sunset Fortress: sit on an old stone bridge above a sea of forest, a castle glowing in the sunset.\n- Enchanted Library: a moonlit reading hall of endless books, a fire crackling behind you.\n- Midnight Void: pure darkness for zero distraction.\n\nPlayer features\n- Plays MP4, MKV, WebM and more, with surround sound\n- 2D, 3D side-by-side / over-under, VR180 and VR360\n- Embedded and external (SRT) subtitles\n- Screen size, distance, height and left/right with exact numbers, remembered every time\n- Curved or flat screen, scene-light dimmer, nature sound on/off\n- Seated and lying-down modes, snap turn, recenter\n- Resume where you left off\n\nAll environments are included. More magical worlds are coming as free updates.", "short_description": "Watch your own movies on a giant screen inside magical, movie-quality 3D worlds: a castle above a moonlit lake, an ancient fortress at sunset, an enchanted library and more. 2D, 3D, VR180 and VR360, subtitles and exact screen controls."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://ky37194-gif.github.io/spellbound-cinema/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Kuldeep Jatav", "support_website_url": "https://ky37194-gif.github.io/spellbound-cinema/", "website_url": "https://ky37194-gif.github.io/spellbound-cinema/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_